---
import { getMaxAudioBytes } from '../../lib/upload.js';
const maxMb = getMaxAudioBytes() / 1024 / 1024;
---
<div class="space-y-5" data-music>
  <div>
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#493D35]">Lagu terpilih</p>
    <p data-music-none class="mt-1 text-xs text-[#6C5E54]">Belum ada lagu dipilih.</p>
    <audio data-music-preview controls preload="none" class="mt-2 hidden w-full"></audio>
    <button type="button" data-music-clear
      class="btn-danger mt-2 hidden px-3 py-1 text-xs">
      Lepas Lagu
    </button>
  </div>

  <div class="border-t border-[#D8C8B5] pt-4">
    <p class="text-sm font-medium text-[#493D35]">Pustaka lagu</p>
    <ul data-music-list class="mt-2 space-y-1.5"></ul>
    <label class="btn-secondary mt-3 cursor-pointer px-3 py-1.5 text-xs">
      Unggah Lagu (MP3, M4A, OGG · maks {maxMb} MB)
      <input type="file" accept="audio/mpeg,audio/mp4,audio/ogg,.mp3,.m4a,.ogg" class="hidden" data-music-upload />
    </label>
    <p data-music-msg class="mt-1.5 text-xs text-[#A34E4E]"></p>
  </div>

  <div class="space-y-2.5 border-t border-[#D8C8B5] pt-4">
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#493D35]">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="music.autoplay" class="accent-[#8B7561]" />
      Putar otomatis saat dibuka
    </label>
    <label class="flex items-center gap-2 text-sm text-[#493D35]">
      <input type="checkbox" data-bind="music.loop" class="accent-[#8B7561]" />
      Ulangi terus (loop)
    </label>
    <div>
      <label for="f-music-volume" class="block text-xs text-[#6C5E54]">Volume pemutaran</label>
      <input id="f-music-volume" type="range" min="0" max="100" step="5"
        data-bind="music.volume" data-type="number" class="mt-1 w-full accent-[#8B7561]" />
    </div>
  </div>

  <p class="text-xs leading-relaxed text-[#6C5E54]">
    Pemutaran otomatis dimulai setelah tamu berinteraksi karena kebijakan browser.
    Penghapusan berkas lagu permanen dilakukan melalui halaman Ringkasan Undangan.
  </p>
  <p class="text-xs text-[#A34E4E]" data-error-for="music.assetId"></p>
</div>